  Schema reference: Modules/Native/GUI/Brushes/Font.xml + Popup.xml
    - Root element is <Brushes> (NOT <BrushDefinitions>)
    - Color format is #RRGGBBAA (NOT 0xAARRGGBB)
    - Text brushes: Font on <Brush>, FontColor/FontSize on <Style Name="Default">
    - Background brushes: need a <BrushLayer Sprite="..."> reference; pure Color alone paints nothing
  Solid fills use the vanilla 'BlankWhiteSquare' sprite tinted via BrushLayer.Color in the Style.
-->
