       ~1-2 value steps off its own background: the chips had no visible body and the label
       colours had almost nothing to sit against. #241B12 is still unmistakably dark (it is
       darker than the #2A2018 header buttons) but the pill now reads as a pill.
       Contrast cost is negligible: #EBB367 on #14100B measured ~10.1:1, on #241B12 ~9.0:1. -->
