  <!-- 2026-08-02 visual pass: section headers in the READING PANE only (CHRONICLE TEXT,
       INFO, DETAILS, SPOILS, MORE FROM, SAME YEAR). Those previously shared
       EEChronicleFilterLabel with the toolbar's EVENT/ENTITY/YEAR labels AND with every
       stat-cell caption, so a major section break looked identical to a cell caption and
       the pane had no visible hierarchy.
       Brighter (#C8A878 vs #8A7654) and one point larger, so contrast against the black
       surfaces goes UP, never down — this change cannot cost readability.
       Deliberately NOT applied to the stat-cell captions: keeping those muted is exactly
       what makes the section headers read as headers. -->
